                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "18a142dd-5438-34d4-bafe-bad1baaf0625",
                        "entry_id": "ab945cb8-6dc6-301b-81e2-85745f015cb3",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Alternative letter-case form of yogi."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "alt-of",
                            "not-comparable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "be15ff88-d3dc-44c2-a3d4-841a4fb7cca7",
                                "sense_id": "18a142dd-5438-34d4-bafe-bad1baaf0625",
                                "text": "In this picture he is performing his famous Yogi trick of swallowing a package of needles and some thread and extracting the needles threaded."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c8057cb1-40f7-4d62-843b-a160b3b1aa8c",
                                "sense_id": "18a142dd-5438-34d4-bafe-bad1baaf0625",
                                "text": "I garaged the car and went to Aunt Dahlia's sanctum to ascertain whether she had cooled off at all since I had left her, for I was still anxious about that blood pressure of hers. One doesn't want aunts going up in a sheet of flame all over the place. She wasn't there, having, I learned later, withdrawn to her room to bathe her temples with eau de Cologne and do Yogi deep-breathing, […]"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            },
            {
                "entry_id": "53b6e91d-5a60-3fe1-9d0f-c0084c3d0858",
                "word": "yogi",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "6327ef2e-e289-48fb-a1b2-263493184a64",
                        "entry_id": "53b6e91d-5a60-3fe1-9d0f-c0084c3d0858",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "yogis"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "d574c4c3-b875-3887-98bd-dc7eda20d4d8",
                        "entry_id": "53b6e91d-5a60-3fe1-9d0f-c0084c3d0858",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A devotee or adherent of yoga."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "2f82bdb4-429c-4ee4-a458-b429a79e8ee1",
                                "sense_id": "d574c4c3-b875-3887-98bd-dc7eda20d4d8",
                                "text": "To this day, yogins find that these disciplines, which have measurable physical and neurological effects, evoke a sense of calm, harmony and equanimity that is comparable to the effect of music."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "33d0c88d-8f6f-478b-9470-1389db633a5a",
                                "sense_id": "d574c4c3-b875-3887-98bd-dc7eda20d4d8",
                                "text": "There is a special healthy menu, and the yogis can all eat together if they choose, but there's none of the birdseed-and-bulgur-wheat diet of a typical retreat."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "70a4c3a1-b61e-42a3-a57c-381d3b6b440b",
                                "sense_id": "d574c4c3-b875-3887-98bd-dc7eda20d4d8",
                                "text": "Gurdjieff connects this type of breathing with yogi breathing."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "85399bc5-6a51-43a3-9fd4-984c643428ca",
                                "sense_id": "d574c4c3-b875-3887-98bd-dc7eda20d4d8",
                                "text": "It's a yogi trick of some sort."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
